chip1: MOVING 0 / STATIC 47 / UNREADABLE 0   (controls passed, so these mean what they say)

EVERY LANE IS STATIC. With the sample loop proven turning, that is
a real reading and not an instrument fault — but check WHICH LOGIC
BITSTREAM IS FLASHED before concluding anything about converters:
`dsp4_logic.a1f6672af6c3`, the one the bench has lived on, predates
the S34 converter-clock fix and drives no BCK/FS to the converters
at all, so every lane reads exactly this (S81).
  python3 dsp4_logic_id.py

